	(text "COOLANT LOOP -> SYS-IO-AUX J801 SPARE TRIP INPUT (ISO1211, 1:1 HARNESS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 353.552 120.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "10e80afb-3ac9-55e6-8925-7123fd3011e9")
	)
	(text "port.CTRL_PINS, 14-way, the PV-PORT harness: DO_SPARE = hold-logic proof test of both ports.\nIMD_SW_P/N not used on DAB60 (no insulation measurement): open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 122.33 74.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1bd19468-98a3-5d8c-a998-1ebe3fe88a99")
	)
	(text "PORT CONNECTOR (CTRL-C2000), ID WITH HOLD READBACK"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "22ce0c9d-8b20-5982-8074-82820cdea898")
	)
	(text "LMR36015ARNXR 400 kHz, 10 uH, 100k / 43.2k -> 3.315 V for 4 x AMC3330 + 2 x AMC3302 + port hold logic + OV comparator\n(SNVSB49D Fig 10-1: 4.7 uF + 220 nF in, 100 nF boot, 1 uF VCC, 2 x 22 uF out). AGND joins GND only here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 333.238 90.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2ee04ba4-5373-5d5d-82ad-5f7d08c7678d")
	)
	(text "Matched dividers on the AMC3330 outputs: OK while VA_P - VA_N < 2.048 V x R1/R2 (common mode rejected);\nOPA2388 as comparator (VOS 7.5 uV; inputs differ by mV at the trip point). Port 1 trips at 986 V (972-1000 V),\nport 2 at 937 V (924-950 V): worst case <= the spec 1000 / 950 V, above the firmware 960 / 920 V.\nResponse 37.5 us (divider 4.99k || 4.7 nF + AMC3330 27.2 us, OPA2388 overload recovery 10 us, logic):\nload-rejection peak 1029 / 970 V. OV_OK low = trip; 10k pull-down: no +3V3S (PORT cable out) trips both."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 197.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "37348f92-6979-579e-a742-77a65ed01abb")
	)
	(text "AUX-HV FEED: PORT 1 ONLY (D-021, INT-11)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 222.07 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3fb9ebeb-a5c1-5dd8-80f2-1255fc4c2633")
	)
	(text "AUX-HV PA+ = J1206 on A_X+ (terminal side of port 1: fuse + EMI filter, ahead of the contactor),\nPA- = J1205 on P1_BUS-. AUX-HV PB+/PB- stay open. Port 2 stud J1406 on B_X+ is DNP: no port-2 tap exists, so\nHV1 and HV2 never meet in the AUX-HV diode OR. Consequence: no black start from port 2 without cabinet 24 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 222.07 36.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4e2c6798-f70e-56b8-81fb-8238d1f5f25c")
	)
	(text "interfaces.PORT: VA/VAX/IA = port 1 (tag A), VB/VBX/IB = port 2 (tag B). AUX1/AUX2 not used (no IMD).\nID: 2.61k || readback = 2.480 k (code 2.49k). RB1/RB2 of port A via 402k, of port B via 133k: nine levels\n0.496-0.632 V within +/-165 mV of the code (PVCELL-25 window starts at 0.667 V); unpowered 0.517 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 107.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "796c405c-4f18-5559-995b-4508103b3795")
	)
	(text "Flow switch (closed while flow > 6 l/min) in series with the cold-plate thermostat (opens at 77 C):\nloop open = channel-A hardware trip on SYS-IO-AUX (latched there, no firmware). SYS wets the loop from 24V_OR\nvia 2.2k into the ISO1211 limiter: 0.00-0.00 mA, <= 30 V open. Contacts: reed (VK3, 1 A / 48 V) and gold\nWE-1 (3106U, 500 mA / 50 V, low-level rated). Pins 3/4 (SYS GND) unused here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 353.552 150.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9177f01e-02df-53e9-bd32-66f7863388c0")
	)
